menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-14346 tc-menu-item tc-menu-depth-0 tc-menu-align-left tc-menu-layout-default\"><a href=\"https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/JEC-Internal-Committee-IC-.pdf\" class=\"tc-menu-inner\">Internal Committee</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-14347 tc-menu-item tc-menu-depth-0 tc-menu-align-left tc-menu-layout-default\"><a href=\"https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/JEC-Internal-Complaint-Committee-ICC-2.pdf\" class=\"tc-menu-inner\">Internal Complaint Committee</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n\t\t</nav>\n\t\t<div id=\"main-content\">    <section class=\"content-area\">\n\t\t<div class=\"top_heading  style_heading_2_out\">\n    <div class=\"top_site_main style_heading_2\" style=\"color: #ffffff;background-image:url(https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/LIBRARY.jpg);\">\n        <span class=\"overlay-top-header\" style=\"\"></span>\n                    <div class=\"page-title-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"banner-wrapper container\">\n                    <h1>Library</h1>                </div>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n    </div><div class=\"container site-content\"><div class=\"row\"><main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main col-sm-12 full-width\">\n\n    \n<article id=\"post-9154\" class=\"post-9154 page type-page status-publish hentry pmpro-has-access\">\n    <div class=\"entry-content\">\n        <div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid margin_btm_0\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"vc_empty_space\"   style=\"height: 30px\" ><span class=\"vc_empty_space_inner\"></span></div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid margin_btm_0\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid margin_btm_0\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div  class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey\"><img width=\"516\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/library1.jpg\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/library1.jpg 516w, https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/library1-300x209.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 516px) 100vw, 516px\" /></div>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p>Our College Library has been built to International Standards, Spread over an area of <strong>60,000sq.ft</strong>. It is centrally air-conditioned. Specialized collection of books, Journals &amp; Non-book materials are available in Basic Sciences, Engineering and Technology, Biotechnology, Humanities and sciences. The collection is replete with <strong>1,30,099 Volumes of Books </strong>(125183 Textbooks and  4916 References) under<strong> 10,072 Titles, </strong>70 National Journals and 64 International journals . The college has access to 744+ e-resources, ASME Journals, IELonline, Springer Link</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid margin_btm_0\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div  class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey\"><img width=\"576\" height=\"384\" src=\"https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/library2.jpg\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/library2.jpg 576w, https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/library2-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px\" /></div>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1521283188967 green_tick\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"inner_head\">Library Facilities:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Digital Library Service</li>\n<li>Reprography Service</li>\n<li>Circulation Service</li>\n<li>Reference Service</li>\n<li>Book Bank Service</li>\n</ul>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  green_tick\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"inner_head\">Library Working Hours:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Monday &#8211; Friday &#8211; 8:00 a.m to 6.00 p.m</li>\n<li>Transactions &#8211; 8.00 a.m to 6.00 p.m</li>\n<li>Digital Library &#8211; 8.00 a.m to 6.00 p.m</li>\n</ul>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid margin_btm_0\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  green_tick\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"inner_head\">Computing Infrastructure:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>IBM x225 Server</li>\n<li>100 core 2 duo Clients</li>\n<li>Network Connections:Internet connection through fiber optic.</li>\n<li>Institutional Membership:British Council Library,Chennai,<br />\nIndian Institute of Technology,ChennaiAnna University,Chennai.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  green_tick link_a\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"inner_head\">E-JOURNALS &#8211; 744+</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ASME Journals (American Society of Mechanical Engg.):<a href=\"http://scitation.aip.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://scitation.aip.org</a></li>\n<li>IEL Online (IEEE &amp; IET): <a href=\"http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://ieeexplore.ieee.org</a></li>\n<li>Springer(Non-medical):<a href=\"http://www.springerlink.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.springerlink.com</a></li>\n<li>WEB OPAC(Online Catalogue):<a href=\"http://www.jeppiaarcollege.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.jeppiaarcollege.org</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid margin_btm_0\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"inner_head\">Special Features:</p>\n<p>Standard textbooks and books by well-known authors are stocked,and every effort is made to obtain all titles recommended by the faculty.</p>\n<p class=\"inner_head\">Membership:</p>\n<p>All Students,faculty and Senior Administrative Staff are members of the library.</p>\n<p class=\"inner_head\">Library Automation:</p>\n<p>The Autolib software is used for Library Automation.</p>\n<p class=\"inner_head\">Bar-coding System:</p>\n<p>All the books are bar-coded in the library and barcode laser scanners are used in the circulation counter for book transaction.</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h3><strong>  Librarian</strong></h3>\n<p>Mr. V. Marikolundu, M.A, M.L.I.S</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div data-vc-full-width=\"true\" data-vc-full-width-init=\"false\" data-vc-parallax=\"1.3\" data-vc-parallax-image=\"https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/hone_parallax.jpg\" class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid thim-bg-overlay new-bg-overlay margin_btm_0 vc_row-has-fill vc_general vc_parallax vc_parallax-content-moving\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_raw_code wpb_content_element wpb_raw_html learn_from\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thim-get-100s\">\n<h2>LEARN FROM <br>WORLD-CLASS<br>EXPERTS</h2>\n<p class=\"get-100s\">& UNLEASH YOUR POTENTIAL TO BREAK NEW GROUND</p>\n</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_raw_code wpb_content_element wpb_raw_html blue_form\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thim-register-now-form\">\n<h3 class=\"title\"><span>Send Enquiry</span>\n<p>Your details will not be published.<br>Required fields are marked.</p>\n</h3>\n\n<div role=\"form\" class=\"wpcf7\" id=\"wpcf7-f85-p9154-o1\" lang=\"en-US\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"></div>\n<form action=\"/jeppiaar/library/#wpcf7-f85-p9154-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form\" novalidate=\"novalidate\">\n<div style=\"display: none;\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"85\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"5.0\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"en_US\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f85-p9154-o1\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"9154\" />\n</div>\n<p><span class=\"wpcf7-f