ult\"><a href=\"https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/JEC-Internal-Committee-IC-.pdf\" class=\"tc-menu-inner\">Internal Committee</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-14347 tc-menu-item tc-menu-depth-0 tc-menu-align-left tc-menu-layout-default\"><a href=\"https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/JEC-Internal-Complaint-Committee-ICC-2.pdf\" class=\"tc-menu-inner\">Internal Complaint Committee</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n\n\t\t</nav>\n\t\t<div id=\"main-content\">    <section class=\"content-area\">\n\t\t<div class=\"top_heading  style_heading_2_out\">\n    <div class=\"top_site_main style_heading_2\" style=\"color: #ffffff;background-image:url(https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/themes/jeppiaar/images/bg-page.jpg);\">\n        <span class=\"overlay-top-header\" style=\"\"></span>\n                    <div class=\"page-title-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"banner-wrapper container\">\n                    <h1>Hostel</h1>                </div>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n    \t\t<div class=\"breadcrumbs-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul itemprop=\"breadcrumb\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\" id=\"breadcrumbs\" class=\"breadcrumbs\"><li itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ListItem\"><a itemprop=\"item\" href=\"https://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar\" title=\"Home\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Home</span></a></li><li itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ListItem\"><span itemprop=\"name\" title=\"Hostel\"> Hostel</span></li></ul>\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div><div class=\"container site-content\"><div class=\"row\"><main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main col-sm-12 full-width\">\n\n    \n<article id=\"post-13929\" class=\"post-13929 page type-page status-publish hentry pmpro-has-access\">\n    <div class=\"entry-content\">\n        <div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \" >\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p>The hostel at Jeppiaar Engineering College in Chennai offers several amenities including 24-hour water and electricity supply, gym facilities and food facility. The accommodation features separate hostels for boys and girls, with rooms generally accommodating three to five students and providing attached bathrooms.</p>\n<p>Mess food is praised for its quality and variety, offering both vegetarian and non-vegetarian options daily.Additional facilities include WiFi, a canteen, and regular cleaning services.</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div>            </div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\n</article><!-- #post-## -->\n\n    \n</main></div></div>    </section>\n\n<footer id=\"colophon\" class=\" site-footer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"footer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<aside id=\"text-5\" class=\"col-sm-4 widget widget_text footer_widget\">\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><div class=\"thim-footer-location\">\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10\" src=\"http://jeppiaarcollege.org/jeppiaar/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/Jeppiaar-Logo-01.png\" alt=\"logo-eduma-the-best-lms-wordpress-theme\" width=\"80%\" height=\"40\" /></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thim-social\">\n<ul class=\"social_link\">\n<li><a class=\"facebook hasTooltip\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/jeppiaarengineeringcollegeofficial/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><i class=\"fa fa-facebook\"></i></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"instagram hasTooltip\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/jeppiaarengineeringcollege/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><i class=\"fa fa-instagram\"></i></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\t\t</aside><aside id=\"text-6\" class=\"col-sm-4 widget widge